  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can endure a Bluff, Intimidate, or Perform check (or any skill check used to inflict a disorientation condition) that succeeds against you (using the skill check DC for enduring—this can cause the skill check to fail, but only against you (not other targets). You can also endure any charm, emotion, or fear effect. The first time you fail a saving throw against a suitable effect each round, you endure it reflexively without using an action; the GM secretly rolls the associated skill check for you.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/body-control#toc29\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
